---
description: implementation order 
alwaysApply: true
---
Always follow this implementation order:
1. Implement any database changes in @schema.prisma
   - STOP and prompt the user to update the database
   - NEVER attempt to migrate or push the database changes yourself
2. Implement any Zod validation type changes in the shared/schema package
   - STOP and prompt the user to rebuild the package
   - NEVER attempt to build the shared/schema package yourself
3. Implement any backend changes
4. Implement any frontend changes
5. Lint and resolve any errors
6. update documentation in shared/docs
7. Do not deploy to the docks unless the user asks. When they do, follow docker-deploy.mdc.
